  "issue_title": "server: wire GatedProvider into HTTP chat completion paths",
  "issue_body": "Part of #569 (gated optional API provider).\n\n**Goal:** enforce the runtime `GatedProvider` gate on HTTP `/api/chat` and `/api/chat/stream` instead of constructing `LocalProvider` directly.\n\n**Scope**\n- Store agent + optional-provider config on `ChatServer`\n- Route blocking chat turns through `gated_provider_for_http`\n- Reject streamed turns with a clear error when the optional API gate is enabled but misconfigured\n\n**Out of scope**\n- Routing completions to a remote HTTP client (follow-up under #569)\n- Voice/Telegram channel adapters (#564)\n\n_M2 \u00b7 Workstream C._",
